Keeps the attribution that a style declares on a GeoJSON source. The style
spec and MapLibre GL JS allow `attribution` on GeoJSON sources, but the GeoJSON
conversion never read it and GeoJSONSource::Impl::getAttribution() returned
nothing, so Source::getAttribution() was empty for
{"type": "geojson", "attribution": "...", "data": ...} while a vector source
with inline tiles and the same attribution reported it. The attribution now
lives in GeoJSONOptions, which every replacement impl copies, so it survives
setGeoJSON, setGeoJSONData, and setURL.
Upstream: not proposed

